<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Mar 03.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Mar 03.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire, Oxfordshire Mar 112.00</p>
<p>London Mar 119.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 99.00 Apr/Jun 102.00/02.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk Apr/Jun 101.50/02.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr/Jun 101.50/02.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Apr/Jun 101.50/02.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire, Oxfordshire Apr 98.50</p>
<p>Avon range Apr 101.00 Apr/Jun 102.00</p>
<p>East Devon Apr/Jun 102.00/02.25</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 99.00/99.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Shropshire/Cheshire Mar 95.50/95.25 Apr 96.00 Apr/Jun 97.00</p>
<p>Southampton Mar 98.50/98.00</p>
</text>
